   "provenance": "Coherent constructor-proven RbxSceneManager and genuine Ogre factory metadata; RTTI confirms hierarchy and type-name slot26. Owned methods avoid DLL-import aliases. Global String uses real CRT initialization in the explicit native state layer. Real Ogre1.4.5 create/destroy bodies now share the protected collection helper and remove excluded public-helper aliases. Runtime covers factory-owned Light lifetime and duplicate creation. Vtable slots206/208/209/212 confirm pointer destroy, bulk destroy and iterator as RbxSceneManager overrides; these replace prior SceneManager/HeaderRecovery donor aliases with authentic types. Camera teardown bodies retain binary-proven inherited native maps. Vtable slots27/30/31/32/80/81/82 prove camera/clearScene/world-geometry methods; filename and stream world-geometry overloads are distinct, correcting an old stream alias at the filename address. Real rgdx plugin supplies RenderSystem camera-removal notifications without opening a render window. Native hasCamera/hasSceneNode overrides (vtable slots29/47) replace old SDK-name aliases so lifecycle queries do not collide with rgmain imports. RenderScene/setPass/queue/graph bodies now share the constructor-proven native class. Binary stores prove mRbxRenderFlag at0x8bb9 adjacent to existing visibility flag. Actual hidden-window D3D9 frame readback exercises native render overrides.",
